id over-regularizing with the richer input, but keep all other architectural details (label smoothing, optimizer, scheduler, early stopping) unchanged to maintain a single controlled experiment. The model interface for forward() gains an `image` parameter, but we keep backward compatibility by providing a default of None to avoid breaking any other code that may call it without images."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
